{"title":"2015 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 23","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Solution_5\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 5</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> be a positive integer greater than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> such that the decimal representation of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/f/63f344e7d8b14a7886fc7fb72da53cd0a3271dcc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n!$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> ends in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> zeros and the decimal representation of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/c/e7c65c2a874b19bdb25e07737a8a098ccd4c292e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2n)!$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"37\" height=\"18\" /> ends in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/6/ce6582d1a31d1fd6bdab19f0d332c8d93adb9c66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3k$\" width=\"18\" height=\"12\" /> zeros. Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/7/f37bba504894945c07a32f5496d74299a37aa51c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> denote the sum of the four least possible values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />. What is the sum of the digits of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/7/f37bba504894945c07a32f5496d74299a37aa51c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/b/30b0a58cd0afed06f2ffa2be23ca1ca98eb3d466.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }7\\qquad\\textbf{(B) }8\\qquad\\textbf{(C) }9\\qquad\\textbf{(D) }10\\qquad\\textbf{(E) }11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"370\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A trailing zero requires a factor of two and a factor of five. Since factors of two occur more often than factors of five, we can focus on the factors of five. We make a chart of how many trailing zeros factorials have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/4/00411b340b9a09060a6751fbc9f261972418994d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\begin{array}{c|c|c|c|c|c|c} \\mathrm{Factorial}&amp;0!-4!&amp;5!-9!&amp;10!-14!&amp;15!-19!&amp;20!-24!&amp;25!-29!\\\\\\hline \\mathrm{Zeros}&amp;0&amp;1&amp;2&amp;3&amp;4&amp;6 \\end{array}\\]\" width=\"562\" height=\"40\" />\n</p><p>We first look at the case when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/f/63f344e7d8b14a7886fc7fb72da53cd0a3271dcc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n!$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> zero and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/c/e7c65c2a874b19bdb25e07737a8a098ccd4c292e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2n)!$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"37\" height=\"18\" /> has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> zeros. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/5/655f50519cf80eed71aa58ff700abad3c921bfae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=5,6,7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"78\" height=\"16\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/c/e7c65c2a874b19bdb25e07737a8a098ccd4c292e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2n)!$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"37\" height=\"18\" /> has only <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> zeros. But for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/2/722aa74359e7217cb3870de7980d645869c04403.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=8,9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"61\" height=\"16\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/c/e7c65c2a874b19bdb25e07737a8a098ccd4c292e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2n)!$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"37\" height=\"18\" /> has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> zeros. Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/4/1d4f171162b090bab7ce5dfa1c58715850530ba5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=8$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/f/18fb781bb0840e30c7a894eac0d3a0f67fcd3157.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=9$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" /> work.\n</p><p>Secondly, we look at the case when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/f/63f344e7d8b14a7886fc7fb72da53cd0a3271dcc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n!$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> zeros and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/c/e7c65c2a874b19bdb25e07737a8a098ccd4c292e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2n)!$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"37\" height=\"18\" /> has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> zeros. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/e/4ae526b8ba7f66cfe7eedad8fda078b4f31eefc1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=10,11,12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"105\" height=\"16\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/c/e7c65c2a874b19bdb25e07737a8a098ccd4c292e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2n)!$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"37\" height=\"18\" /> has only <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> zeros. But for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/5/1c54ce65e0f4319149afe8ddd46404399fe2a1f6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=13,14$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"79\" height=\"16\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/c/e7c65c2a874b19bdb25e07737a8a098ccd4c292e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2n)!$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"37\" height=\"18\" /> has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> zeros. Thus, the smallest four values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> that work are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/5/f054c3e72e5c8ca7811dedd0163623445c2e8026.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=8,9,13,14$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"114\" height=\"16\" />, which sum to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/4/5b45828f292e161290be6ee62bc4c9df081ee1e1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$44$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. The sum of the digits of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/4/5b45828f292e161290be6ee62bc4c9df081ee1e1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$44$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/9/e99cea4d505a82e825177f87a6514e10823564be.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\mathbf{(B)\\ }8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"55\" height=\"29\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>By <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Legendre%27s_Formula\" title=\"Legendre&#39;s Formula\">Legendre's Formula</a> and the information given, we have that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/4/f14b122093beeef4619146c3660c941030fa17ff.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3\\left(\\left\\lfloor{\\frac{n}{5}}\\right\\rfloor+\\left\\lfloor{\\frac{n}{25}}\\right\\rfloor\\right)=\\left\\lfloor{\\frac{2n}{5}}\\right\\rfloor+\\left\\lfloor{\\frac{2n}{25}}\\right\\rfloor$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"261\" height=\"43\" />.\n</p><p>We have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/c/06cb3e6647917685deda719540d3ef0a8cc7c4e1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n&lt;100$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"61\" height=\"13\" /> as there is no way that if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/9/749d949bbc25017ebc3df68b3862430e44b1af16.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n&gt;100$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"61\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/c/e7c65c2a874b19bdb25e07737a8a098ccd4c292e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2n)!$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"37\" height=\"18\" /> would have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> times as many zeroes as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/f/63f344e7d8b14a7886fc7fb72da53cd0a3271dcc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n!$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>First, let's plug in the number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.\nWe get that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/9/ec96016e73c3d450d892035737b4962946dfcf22.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3(1)=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"64\" height=\"18\" />, which is obviously not true. Hence, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/c/f2c57d1f5101d7fe31db3c0b42f2d45f5ca0fc81.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n&gt;5$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"43\" height=\"13\" />\n</p><p>After several attempts, we realize that the RHS needs <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> more \"extra\" zeroes than the LHS. Hence, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> is greater than a multiple of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>We find that the least four possible <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/6/6164386f664a7122d6d779b2bdf785f008b58072.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8,9,13,14$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"78\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/3/f839ce6a74ce60a37490238209958dcc83762875.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8+9+13+14=17+27=44\\implies 4+4=8\\implies\\boxed{B}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"445\" height=\"24\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/7/89743b3673811e94f13e0f6498b6cbdce88a5b24.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=5m+k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"92\" height=\"14\" /> for some natural numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/e/ade5f6087a425613fd2f50066cedc6d63cad2294.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k\\in\\{0,1,2,3,4\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"130\" height=\"20\" />. Notice that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/c/f1c0b8956c0da4bf4aea39caf16d540160a0bc52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n&lt;5^3=125$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"102\" height=\"15\" />. Thus \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/2/572e0b19280a1a9c2128e890d557d06169df3eda.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[3(\\left\\lfloor\\frac{n}{5}\\right\\rfloor+\\left\\lfloor\\frac{n}{25}\\right\\rfloor)=\\left\\lfloor\\frac{2n}{5}\\right\\rfloor+\\left\\lfloor\\frac{2n}{25}\\right\\rfloor+\\left\\lfloor\\frac{2n}{125}\\right\\rfloor\\]\" width=\"325\" height=\"43\" />\nFor smaller <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />, we temporarily let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/8/f78cea6a92c15f75cca4c7a6ca5278781baa63cb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left\\lfloor\\frac{2n}{125}\\right\\rfloor=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"87\" height=\"45\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/a/a7a0887f13f2ae3d8e2320c8e36c195ff4fde066.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[3(\\left\\lfloor\\frac{n}{5}\\right\\rfloor+\\left\\lfloor\\frac{n}{25}\\right\\rfloor)=\\left\\lfloor\\frac{2n}{5}\\right\\rfloor+\\left\\lfloor\\frac{2n}{25}\\right\\rfloor\\]\" width=\"251\" height=\"43\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/0/3908ac963593a9eaba20c6b0f6da69900b31c0e2.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[3(\\left\\lfloor\\frac{5m+k}{5}\\right\\rfloor+\\left\\lfloor\\frac{5m+k}{25}\\right\\rfloor)=\\left\\lfloor\\frac{2(5m+k)}{5}\\right\\rfloor+\\left\\lfloor\\frac{2(5m+k)}{25}\\right\\rfloor\\]\" width=\"462\" height=\"43\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/8/1281b24e835c10ca0b430d1cb9c53c3139ca4ec6.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[3(\\left\\lfloor\\frac{5m+k}{5}\\right\\rfloor+\\left\\lfloor\\frac{5m+k}{25}\\right\\rfloor)=\\left\\lfloor\\frac{10m+2k}{5}\\right\\rfloor+\\left\\lfloor\\frac{10m+2k}{25}\\right\\rfloor\\]\" width=\"452\" height=\"43\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/0/cf0dce95803a0343bf1d6848c0d88b22fd64699b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[3m+3\\left\\lfloor\\frac{5m+k}{25}\\right\\rfloor=2m+\\left\\lfloor\\frac{2k}{5}\\right\\rfloor+\\left\\lfloor\\frac{10m+2k}{25}\\right\\rfloor\\]\" width=\"374\" height=\"43\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/4/fe432c059a3cbba308a56ebf543eb81cd8658167.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[m+3\\left\\lfloor\\frac{5m+k}{25}\\right\\rfloor=\\left\\lfloor\\frac{2k}{5}\\right\\rfloor+\\left\\lfloor\\frac{10m+2k}{25}\\right\\rfloor\\]\" width=\"318\" height=\"43\" />\nTo minimize <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />, we let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/6/e3689a27ac2af33d04aa55bac97da7286a04e346.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left\\lfloor\\frac{5m+k}{25}\\right\\rfloor=\\left\\lfloor\\frac{10m+2k}{25}\\right\\rfloor=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"242\" height=\"45\" />, then\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/2/26261b926e572606703547d4c12591992237ebbd.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[m=\\left\\lfloor\\frac{2k}{5}\\right\\rfloor\\]\" width=\"79\" height=\"43\" />\nSince <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/0/640828fdfe1e34bc6bdaacffae98d55b439f3a72.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k&lt;5$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"43\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/3/073b68444caca3c51f4ce50ee7fe4e5939755e22.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m&gt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"48\" height=\"13\" />, the only integral value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, from which we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/b/72b292e47ef6eb9e0ea329a29b76328b7593755b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k=3,4\\Longrightarrow n=8,9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"161\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p><p>Now we let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/f/29f679230c6096e92b10a2997e389b9efd666fda.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left\\lfloor\\frac{5m+k}{25}\\right\\rfloor=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"117\" height=\"45\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/5/385c6bad733252433b44f924da961869f499faa5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left\\lfloor\\frac{10m+2k}{25}\\right\\rfloor=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"135\" height=\"45\" />, then\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/f/dbf517547925e8959759bcbda9c53469086c68f6.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[m=\\left\\lfloor\\frac{2k}{5}\\right\\rfloor+\\left\\lfloor\\frac{10m+2k}{25}\\right\\rfloor\\]\" width=\"202\" height=\"43\" />\nSince <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/0/640828fdfe1e34bc6bdaacffae98d55b439f3a72.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k&lt;5$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"43\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/0/5502b5cffd4e8931977c4de29745e17bab8c4e84.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10m&gt;15\\Longrightarrow m\\ge2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"164\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/4/b54b2efe5c5111c7e6c198528ba6ba294ae0bf8d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m&gt;2$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"48\" height=\"12\" />, then\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/d/7adc36648e5136079bc2c9ff269a376fe6b491a6.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[m&gt;\\left\\lfloor\\frac{2k}{5}\\right\\rfloor+\\left\\lfloor\\frac{10m+2k}{25}\\right\\rfloor\\]\" width=\"202\" height=\"43\" />\nwhich is a contradiction.\n</p><p>Thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/9/0a9f65e4e8a1c19484cf2a5ee6894ea9cc3e2f37.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m=2\\Longrightarrow\\left\\lfloor\\frac{2k}{5}\\right\\rfloor=1\\Longrightarrow n=13,14$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"287\" height=\"45\" />\n</p><p>Finally, the sum of the four smallest possible <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/d/eed4add9990ee328b38b39a2dc2679bff413edd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=8+9+13+14=44$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"198\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/a/05a3ce1fd353c0e835d2d48c30b5a4d8ac9ee86e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4+4=8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"73\" height=\"14\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/2/c72a08c9de59fb963e17912f4b2127a20340346a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\mathrm{(B)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"38\" height=\"29\" />\n</p><p>~ Nafer\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4\">Solution 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We first note that the number of 0's in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/f/63f344e7d8b14a7886fc7fb72da53cd0a3271dcc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n!$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> is determined by how many 5's are in the prime factorization. We use Legendre's Formula and split up into two cases:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/a/ccad89fc6bf3acedebe15f57cf963968ea762596.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{CASE ONE: } 5\\leq 2n &lt; 25.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"214\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p>The only way we can fulfill the requirements is if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/4/034315345e79187324657032323d21e19b4ae5d9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\lfloor{\\dfrac{n}{5}}\\rfloor = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"66\" height=\"34\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/8/eb8a0626279afe534862e4486ceeb801849bfc9f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\lfloor{\\dfrac{2n}{5}}\\rfloor=3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"75\" height=\"38\" /> which means that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/7/b/47b250d1dcec253dd9d80d69d48f7c9a6bbdc82b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5\\leq n &lt;10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"89\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/f/20f33bd8746dcf5762f8ef1138c5f005e2ee620d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15\\leq 2n &lt; 20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"107\" height=\"16\" />. The only way this works is if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/0/ce095676fc619c1b76a6beb63c199bf1ef5999c7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = 8 \\text{ or } 9.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"86\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/7/e/47ed51422fa76e2be664156545a4ce60946c491f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{CASE TWO: } 25 \\leq 2n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"181\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p><p>Since we want the smallest values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />, we first try it when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/a/82a3ef1aae843b6dfbfa0f1d722ac24999e8d125.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2n&lt;30.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"69\" height=\"15\" /> Thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/c/e7c65c2a874b19bdb25e07737a8a098ccd4c292e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2n)!$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"37\" height=\"18\" /> has 6 zeros, which implies that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/f/63f344e7d8b14a7886fc7fb72da53cd0a3271dcc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n!$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> must have 2. The only way to do this while maintaining our restrictions for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/3/f93f5c51ea4b04b4992b003b39479f29018f6bda.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2n$\" width=\"19\" height=\"12\" /> is if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/2/4/b241d315e2f66fbe2488ae38db2d104c5ba6aa30.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = 13 \\text{ or } 14.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"104\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p>So the sum of the four values is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/8/ad81124f99f73313ff91d68b3b04fbdddcaa97ef.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8+9+13+14=44$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"165\" height=\"15\" /> so the digit is sum is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/9/139aff62411176aa6c91cdbb56efa5dca341520b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\mathbf{(B)\\ }8}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"62\" height=\"32\" />\n</p><p>-ConfidentKoala4\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_5\">Solution 5</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 5\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We will use trial and error to determine the answer to this problem. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/3/ec37f4048b4f92c2227c9bfe79fcb7d52ab99c9c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = 5$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/f/63f344e7d8b14a7886fc7fb72da53cd0a3271dcc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n!$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> has  <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> zero, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/c/34c9f2fc1df32ee4027c641f6976d8685ba87520.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2n!$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"27\" height=\"14\" /> will have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> zeros. But <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/6/0/16088b6490d5842dd350d8988c6156ce9aeab8c6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3 \\cdot 1 \\neq 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"66\" height=\"18\" /> so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/3/ec37f4048b4f92c2227c9bfe79fcb7d52ab99c9c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = 5$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" /> does not work. Similarly <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/5/cd5ac46d514d043d75bc14150534a9476e354036.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = 6, 7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"63\" height=\"17\" /> do not work either. But <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/8/26858c2becbfe024f2a38f506fce66d56f3e0b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = 8$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" /> works because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/3/7/9370839bbb8a8037471714de7c7c5a52804b5a75.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8!$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> zero and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/2/74237b1eb3cfe0e051e6514f3cd176e5efeb13ec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$16!$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"21\" height=\"13\" /> has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> zeros. Note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/1/1819f547a53f667e1a44a49ba2bec08c28d7f222.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = 9$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" /> also works because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/f/22f925a6f7de3d6e06f740617bc11b55a1f97184.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9!$\" width=\"12\" height=\"13\" /> has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> zero and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/0/980652235199d55d04b7f9da22c5ac8cb491234c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$18!$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"21\" height=\"13\" /> has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> zeros. After performing trial and error several times, we find that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/e/5/1e53926ccd355f33371f44c236a5104ded26ed83.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = 10, 11, 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"108\" height=\"17\" /> do not work but <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/2/ff2b16f3c05128fb0869c9f25a7e5fd1fc8afda3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = 13, 14$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"81\" height=\"17\" /> do work. Therefore, the four smallest values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/1/1212efda79c4efc14d6b0b1586a5cde39a93c03a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8, 9, 13, 14$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"81\" height=\"17\" />. Therefore adding them together gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/4/5b45828f292e161290be6ee62bc4c9df081ee1e1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$44$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> and our answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/9/139aff62411176aa6c91cdbb56efa5dca341520b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\mathbf{(B)\\ }8}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"62\" height=\"32\" />\n</p><p>-<a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=User:Yiyj1&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"User:Yiyj1 (page does not exist)\">Yiyj1</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10B\" title=\"2015 AMC 10B\">2015 AMC 10B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10B_Problems\" title=\"2015 AMC 10B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2015 AMC 10B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"2015 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 22\">Problem 22</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"2015 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 24\">Problem 24</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2015 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2015 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2015 AMC 10B Problems/Problem